Production-ready SageMaker security configuration:

```json
// IAM Role for SageMaker Training Job (Least Privilege)
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": [
        "s3:GetObject",
        "s3:GetBucketLocation"
      ],
      "Resource": [
        "arn:aws:s3:::ml-training-data",
        "arn:aws:s3:::ml-training-data/*"
      ],
      "Condition": {
        "StringEquals": {
          "s3:x-amz-server-side-encryption": "aws:kms"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": [
        "s3:PutObject"
      ],
      "Resource": [
        "arn:aws:s3:::ml-model-artifacts/*"
      ],
      "Condition": {
        "StringEquals": {
          "s3:x-amz-server-side-encryption": "aws:kms"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "Effect": "Deny",
      "Action": ["s3:*"],
      "Resource": "arn:aws:s3:::*",
      "Condition": {
        "Bool": {"aws:SecureTransport": "false"}
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

```python
# Secure SageMaker Training Job Configuration
import sagemaker
from sagemaker.estimator import Estimator

estimator = Estimator(
    image_uri='123456789012.dkr.ecr.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/ml-training:latest',
    role='arn:aws:iam::123456789012:role/SageMakerTrainingRole',
    instance_count=2,
    instance_type='ml.p3.2xlarge',
    # Security configurations
    encrypt_inter_container_traffic=True,  # Encrypt between distributed nodes
    output_path='s3://ml-model-artifacts/encrypted/',
    # VPC configuration - no internet access
    subnets=['subnet-abc123', 'subnet-def456'],
    security_group_ids=['sg-ml-training'],
    # Enable network isolation
    disable_profiler=False,
)

# Launch training with KMS encryption
estimator.fit(
    inputs={'train': sagemaker.inputs.TrainingInput(
        s3_data='s3://ml-training-data/dataset/',
        content_type='text/csv',
        # Required: KMS encryption for data at rest
        s3_data_type='S3Prefix',
        input_mode='File'
    )},
    encrypt_inter_container_traffic=True,
    wait=True
)
```

**Key security controls:** VPC isolation, inter-container encryption, KMS encryption, least-privilege IAM, no internet access.
